    "brand.product3.desc": "“Light It Up! Courage Gift Box” is a standard on-sale gift box.\n\nThe box is made from recycled reusable packaging, awarded the Golden Pin Design Award and iF Design Award, and has been exhibited in Japan, Hong Kong, and the Netherlands. Contents include Beigang Chinese medicine shop mosquito repellent sachet, Road Walker mugwort incense, cow dung incense, portable tin box, and “Light Up Courage” lighter. Besides repelling mosquitoes, it supports brave individuals.\n\nThe Road Walker mugwort incense project is nearing its 10th year, produced by the Mugwort Heart Association. These formerly homeless participants initially lacked abilities and life goals or hope; the simple design and production of mugwort incense by Mugwort Heart allows them to live and work together. Through this straightforward handicraft, many have rebuilt life goals, regaining the courage for self-reliance.\n\n“Light It Up! Courage Gift Box” is ideal for friends who love outdoor activities—repel mosquitoes while sharing meaningful stories, supporting those living bravely. Through stories like Kao Yi-hsin’s cow dung incense and Road Walker’s mugwort tale, it encourages: “Courage can be ignited.”\n『点燃吧！勇気ギフトボックス』は通常販売ギフトボックスです。\n\nギフトボックスは循環回收パッケージ製で、金点設計賞とiFデザイン賞を受賞、日本・香港・オランダで展示。内容物：北港中薬行防蚊パック/路行者艾草香/牛糞薫香/携帯鉄箱/「点燃勇気」ライター。除蚊以外、勇敢な人々を支援。\n\n路行者艾草香プロジェクトは10年近く、製作は芒草心協会。元ストリート友人たちは当初無力で人生目標・希望喪失。小吼のシンプル艾草香製作で集まり生活・労働、こうした簡単手工で多くの人が人生目標再構築、自立の勇気を取り戻す。\n\n『点燃吧！勇気ギフトボックス』はアウトドア好きの友人に最適、防蚊しながら意味ある物語共有、勇敢生活支援。牛糞薫香の高一鑫物語、路行者艾草物語で「勇気は点火できる」と励ます。"
